          "url": "https://github.com/abhinaykrupa/cowork-to-code-bridge/blob/30b06c2fb24a916c835a2928d2d274727faab09b/README.md#L510-L514"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_d138a503fce0b434c0762f79b0b5f4e128d512e6cbc8aee0ea794076193f5912"
      ],
      "text": "The daemon only runs scripts from ~/.cowork-to-code-bridge/scripts/ whose names match a strict pattern (no path tricks or symlinks), rejects commands with a wrong token, and runs as the normal user without sudo."
    },
