        "slc_8692ede7e3c769a5de716954267ebfbe2d4c3b5db587173affbe36cb5c761742",
        "slc_a3df627a8eb7b11c5947c710f265722bb28ee44a47bc96439d9e2a9f98f73a08"
      ],
      "text": "Per-task controls include a spend cap (max_budget_usd, shown as 2.00 in an example), a permission scope (readonly, plan, edit, or full), and model tier/effort selection; owner-set ceilings (BRIDGE_MAX_BUDGET_USD, BRIDGE_PERMISSION_CEILING) take precedence, with the stricter value winning."
    },
