        "slc_ffbbf5627fb7696517eeae98cce7e3548eda6a396068909f51fcbc9739373bcf"
      ],
      "text": "Native Windows is not supported yet; Windows users must install inside WSL2 (Ubuntu) with systemd enabled. The README also lists threats the bridge cannot defend against, including malicious user-written scripts and an attacker who already has filesystem write access."
    },
