        "slc_9ed9b0e3bf8775b06c084c5a22c7624d5d55619915ae8b0c1c4776737a1ca49a"
      ],
      "text": "The pip install provides console scripts cowork-to-code-bridge-daemon, -uninstall, and -selfcheck; selfcheck checks six items, prints PASS/FAIL per check, and exits 0 if all pass or 1 if any fail."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
