        "slc_993881ba6c4563f859a9d128dbfdf74e82e0060d4d326755eaf74b1fbf6d7586"
      ],
      "text": "An optional plan-approval hook (approve_plan.sh) gates tasks carrying a plan field: exit 0 proceeds and exit 2 rejects with the hook's message returned to Cowork; if the file does not exist, the plan field is silently ignored."
    }
